# S14zb, room owner o: a new account (no online story: the room starts at zero). It sits at the title until the guest has
# played its lobby and the first briefing, then the campaign bot starts a new game: its lobby starts the story and gives the
# room phase 1. It stays in the lobby (present) until the guest has left its briefing.
log at the title
idle until epoch>=@360
campaign until stage=stagml11
talk until control,frames>=60
log owner in the lobby
idle until frames>=15000
log owner done
